    "number": 31,
    "summary": "Pharaoh’s glory and fall are compared to that of the Assyrians.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass in the eleventh year, in the third month, in the first day of the month, that the word of the Lord came unto me, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 55,
