        "reference": "Ezekiel 31:1",
        "book": "Ezekiel",
        "chapter": 31,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Son of man, speak unto Pharaoh king of Egypt, and to his multitude; Whom art thou like in thy greatness?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 44,
            "text": "Isa. 19:1; Ezek. 32:2."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
